        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Haan! तीनों equations याद रखो: 1) v = u + at, 2) s = ut + ½at², 3) v² = u² + 2as. यहाँ u = initial velocity, v = final velocity, a = acceleration, t = time, s = distance/displacement."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
