          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Sir example?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Car की initial speed 10 m/s है, acceleration 2 m/s², 5 seconds बाद speed? v = u + at = 10 + (2×5) = 10 + 10 = 20 m/s! ⭐ SSC/Railway में direct substitution questions आते हैं!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Wow! Simple substitution!"
